# Enterprise AI Data Analyst for JGH Database - Implementation & Verification Plan

An Enterprise AI Data Analyst platform built for non-technical users to query the live JGH MySQL database in plain English, generating optimized SQL, executing on the live database, and producing downloadable CSV, Excel, and PDF reports.

## System Architecture & Pipeline Overview

```
User Business Question (Plain English)
  │
  ▼
[ 1. Business Intent & Entity Resolution ]
  ├─ In-Memory Dynamic Knowledge Graph (Schema, Relationships, Business Dictionary)
  ├─ Lookup Master Resolution (e.g. "Retailer" -> users.user_role = 2, "Wholesaler" -> users.user_role = 5)
  └─ Shortest Path Join Graph (BFS between detected entities)
  │
  ▼
[ 2. Deterministic Query Planning ]
  ├─ Exact Target Tables & Columns (Explicit projection, NO SELECT *)
  ├─ Exact JOIN clauses (e.g. users.id = wallet_transaction.user_id, users.user_role = role.id)
  ├─ Date Range & Enum Filter Resolution
  └─ LIMIT 500 default enforcement for safety
  │
  ▼
[ 3. Local LLM SQL Generation (Qwen2.5-Coder 7B via Ollama) ]
  ├─ Compressed execution plan prompt (Minimal tokens for sub-second generation)
  └─ Multi-step reasoning with self-correction feedback loop
  │
  ▼
[ 4. Multi-Layer SQL Validation ]
  ├─ AST Syntax & Safety Validation (sqlglot - Strict SELECT only, zero mutations)
  ├─ Target Table & Column Scope Validation (Only allowed business tables)
  └─ Live MySQL EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON Execution Plan Cost Verification
  │
  ▼
[ 5. Live Database Execution (MySQL Single Source of Truth) ]
  ├─ Connection pool with PyMySQL / SQLAlchemy
  ├─ Strict read-only execution with millisecond timing
  └─ Clean NaN/Decimal/DateTime JSON serialization
  │
  ▼
[ 6. Natural Language Synthesis & Multi-Format Reporting ]
  ├─ Instant Natural Language Summary (Transaction totals, record metrics)
  ├─ Interactive Frontend Grid & AutoChart (Bar, Line, Area, Pie charts)
  └─ Downloadable Reports: CSV, Excel (.xlsx), and PDF
```

